<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Word" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="441120471"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1161504043"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="That's What I Like"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Bruno Mars"/><amll:meta key="album" value="24K Magic"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:26.697"><div begin="00:00.539" end="03:23.228"><p begin="00:00.539" end="00:03.095" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:00.539" end="00:01.507">Aye,</span> <span begin="00:01.548" end="00:02.368">aye,</span> <span begin="00:02.385" end="00:03.095">aye</span></p><p begin="00:03.104" end="00:05.108" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:03.104" end="00:03.304">I</span> <span begin="00:03.304" end="00:03.637">got</span> <span begin="00:03.637" end="00:03.775">a</span> <span begin="00:03.775" end="00:04.287">condo</span> <span begin="00:04.287" end="00:04.447">in</span> <span begin="00:04.447" end="00:05.108">Manhattan</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我在曼哈顿买了座公寓</span></p><p begin="00:05.502" end="00:07.288" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:05.502" end="00:05.974">Baby</span> <span begin="00:05.974" end="00:06.227">girl,</span> <span begin="00:06.227" end="00:06.505">what's</span> <span begin="00:06.505" end="00:06.846">happenin'?</span> <span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="00:06.739" end="00:07.288"><span begin="00:06.739" end="00:06.948">(What's</span> <span begin="00:06.948" end="00:07.288">happenin'?)</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">亲爱的 你要来吗</span></p><p begin="00:07.353" end="00:08.893" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:07.353" end="00:07.503">You</span> <span begin="00:07.503" end="00:07.657">and</span> <span begin="00:07.657" end="00:07.879">your</span> <span begin="00:07.879" end="00:08.101">ass</span> <span begin="00:08.101" end="00:08.893">invited</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">来的话我无比欢迎</span></p><p begin="00:08.903" end="00:10.856" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:08.903" end="00:09.127">So</span> <span begin="00:09.127" end="00:09.251">go</span> <span begin="00:09.251" end="00:09.374">on</span> <span begin="00:09.374" end="00:09.571">and</span> <span begin="00:09.571" end="00:09.749">get</span> <span begin="00:09.749" end="00:09.967">to</span> <span begin="00:09.967" end="00:10.582">clappin'</span> <span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="00:10.323" end="00:10.856"><span begin="00:10.323" end="00:10.515">(To</span> <span begin="00:10.515" end="00:10.856">clappin')</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">跟着人群鼓掌</span></p><p begin="00:10.786" end="00:12.250" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:10.786" end="00:10.973">So</span> <span begin="00:10.973" end="00:11.165">pop</span> <span begin="00:11.165" end="00:11.351">it</span> <span begin="00:11.351" end="00:11.558">for</span> <span begin="00:11.558" end="00:11.701">a</span> <span begin="00:11.701" end="00:12.250">player</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">看是谁帅得这么骚气</span></p><p begin="00:12.257" end="00:13.807" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:12.257" end="00:12.638">Pop,</span> <span begin="00:12.709" end="00:12.908">pop</span> <span begin="00:12.908" end="00:13.097">it</span> <span begin="00:13.097" end="00:13.344">for</span> <span begin="00:13.344" end="00:13.807">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是我无疑</span></p><p begin="00:13.818" end="00:15.794" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:13.818" end="00:13.981">Turn</span> <span begin="00:13.981" end="00:14.316">around</span> <span begin="00:14.316" end="00:14.489">and</span> <span begin="00:14.489" end="00:14.736">drop</span> <span begin="00:14.736" end="00:14.883">it</span> <span begin="00:14.883" end="00:15.086">for</span> <span begin="00:15.086" end="00:15.300">a</span> <span begin="00:15.300" end="00:15.794">player</span> <span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="00:14.933" end="00:15.450"><span begin="00:14.933" end="00:15.179">(Drop</span> <span begin="00:15.179" end="00:15.450">it)</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">快转过身来鼓掌欢迎</span></p><p begin="00:15.804" end="00:17.239" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:15.804" end="00:16.204">Drop,</span> <span begin="00:16.204" end="00:16.444">drop</span> <span begin="00:16.444" end="00:16.626">it</span> <span begin="00:16.626" end="00:16.871">for</span> <span begin="00:16.871" end="00:17.239">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为我的到来致意</span></p><p begin="00:17.378" end="00:19.813" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="00:17.378" end="00:17.597">I'll</span> <span begin="00:17.597" end="00:17.877">rent</span> <span begin="00:17.877" end="00:17.977">a</span> <span begin="00:17.977" end="00:18.282">beach</span> <span begin="00:18.282" end="00:18.548">house</span> <span begin="00:18.548" end="00:18.739">in</span> <span begin="00:18.739" end="00:19.466">Miami</span> <span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="00:19.477" end="00:19.813"><span begin="00:19.477" end="00:19.813">('ami)</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我将要租下迈阿密的沙滩豪宅</span></p><p begin="00:19.878" end="00:21.546" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="00:19.878" end="00:20.098">Wake</span> <span begin="00:20.098" end="00:20.318">up</span> <span begin="00:20.318" end="00:20.544">with</span> <span begin="00:20.544" end="00:20.767">no</span> <span begin="00:20.767" end="00:21.364">jammies</span> <span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="00:21.146" end="00:21.546"><span begin="00:21.146" end="00:21.546">(Nope)</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">睡觉不穿睡衣也惬意自在</span></p><p begin="00:21.622" end="00:23.330" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="00:21.622" end="00:22.094">Lobster</span> <span begin="00:22.094" end="00:22.358">tail</span> <span begin="00:22.358" end="00:22.585">for</span> <span begin="00:22.585" end="00:23.192">dinner</span> <span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="00:23.029" end="00:23.330"><span begin="00:23.029" end="00:23.330">(Huh)</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">各种高档海鲜就是我的晚餐</span></p><p begin="00:23.443" end="00:25.130" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="00:23.443" end="00:23.862">Julio,</span> <span begin="00:23.862" end="00:24.107">serve</span> <span begin="00:24.107" end="00:24.291">that</span> <span begin="00:24.291" end="00:24.998">scampi</span> <span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="00:24.597" end="00:25.130"><span begin="00:24.597" end="00:25.130">(Julio)</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">胡利奥为我剥虾伺候我吃饭</span></p><p begin="00:25.070" end="00:26.561" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="00:25.070" end="00:25.309">You</span> <span begin="00:25.309" end="00:25.525">got</span> <span begin="00:25.525" end="00:25.680">it</span> <span begin="00:25.680" end="00:25.867">if</span> <span begin="00:25.867" end="00:26.112">you</span> <span begin="00:26.112" end="00:26.363">want</span> <span begin="00:26.363" end="00:26.561">it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果你想要就来我这里</span></p><p begin="00:26.574" end="00:28.286" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="00:26.574" end="00:26.933">Got,</span> <span begin="00:27.046" end="00:27.323">got</span> <span begin="00:27.323" end="00:27.468">it</span> <span begin="00:27.468" end="00:27.598">if</span> <span begin="00:27.598" end="00:27.817">you</span> <span begin="00:27.817" end="00:28.084">want</span> <span begin="00:28.084" end="00:28.286">it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果你想要这种生活我都能给你</span></p><p begin="00:28.299" end="00:30.083" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="00:28.299" end="00:28.617">Said,</span> <span begin="00:28.617" end="00:28.777">you</span> <span begin="00:28.777" end="00:29.097">got</span> <span begin="00:29.097" end="00:29.297">it</span> <span begin="00:29.297" end="00:29.532">if</span> <span begin="00:29.532" end="00:29.737">you</span> <span begin="00:29.737" end="00:29.926">want</span> <span begin="00:29.926" end="00:30.083">it</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想要就来我这里</span></p><p begin="00:30.089" end="00:32.363" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17"><span begin="00:30.089" end="00:30.398">Take</span> <span begin="00:30.398" end="00:30.624">my</span> <span begin="00:30.624" end="00:31.110">wallet</span> <span begin="00:31.110" end="00:31.296">if</span> <span begin="00:31.296" end="00:31.486">you</span> <span begin="00:31.486" end="00:31.736">want</span> <span begin="00:31.736" end="00:31.939">it,</span> <span begin="00:31.939" end="00:32.363">now</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要你想 拿走我的钱包 花多少都随意</span></p><p begin="00:32.361" end="00:36.009" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18"><span begin="00:32.361" end="00:32.809">Jump</span> <span begin="00:32.831" end="00:33.024">in</span> <span begin="00:33.024" end="00:33.334">the</span> <span begin="00:33.334" end="00:34.197">Cadillac</span> <span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="00:34.196" end="00:36.009"><span begin="00:34.196" end="00:34.456">(Girl,</span> <span begin="00:34.456" end="00:34.674">let's</span> <span begin="00:34.674" end="00:34.861">put</span> <span begin="00:34.861" end="00:35.128">some</span> <span begin="00:35.128" end="00:35.548">miles</span> <span begin="00:35.548" end="00:35.731">on</span> <span begin="00:35.731" end="00:36.009">it)</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">跳进我的凯迪拉克里 走吧 我带你兜风去</span></p><p begin="00:36.386" end="00:39.532" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19"><span begin="00:36.386" end="00:37.159">Anything</span> <span begin="00:37.159" end="00:37.375">you</span> <span begin="00:37.375" end="00:37.751">want</span> <span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="00:37.761" end="00:39.532"><span begin="00:37.761" end="00:37.978">(Just</span> <span begin="00:37.978" end="00:38.155">to</span> <span begin="00:38.155" end="00:38.468">put</span> <span begin="00:38.468" end="00:38.639">a</span> <span begin="00:38.639" end="00:39.068">smile</span> <span begin="00:39.068" end="00:39.279">on</span> <span begin="00:39.279" end="00:39.532">it)</span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要你微微一笑 你要什么都随你</span></p><p begin="00:39.541" end="00:40.897" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20"><span begin="00:39.541" end="00:39.909">You</span> <span begin="00:39.909" end="00:40.186">deserve</span> <span begin="00:40.186" end="00:40.438">it,</span> <span begin="00:40.438" end="00:40.897">baby</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你值得拥有 也值得我这样为你</span></p><p begin="00:40.906" end="00:42.778" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21"><span begin="00:40.906" end="00:41.158">You</span> <span begin="00:41.158" end="00:41.593">deserve</span> <span begin="00:41.593" end="00:41.774">it</span> <span begin="00:41.774" end="00:42.778">all</span></p><p begin="00:42.886" end="00:45.392" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22"><span begin="00:42.886" end="00:43.158">And</span> <span begin="00:43.158" end="00:43.467">I'm</span> <span begin="00:43.467" end="00:43.921">gonna</span> <span begin="00:43.921" end="00:44.222">give</span> <span begin="00:44.222" end="00:44.585">it</span> <span begin="00:44.585" end="00:44.795">to</span> <span begin="00:44.795" end="00:45.392">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你要的我也都会给你</span></p><p begin="00:45.404" end="00:48.709" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23"><span begin="00:45.404" end="00:45.755">Gold</span> <span begin="00:45.755" end="00:46.696">jewelry</span> <span begin="00:46.696" end="00:47.627">shining</span> <span begin="00:47.627" end="00:47.979">so</span> <span begin